      "content": "<h3>Creating a HashMap: four constructors</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>new HashMap&lt;&gt;()</code>: empty, capacity 16, load factor 0.75.</li>\n<li><code>new HashMap&lt;&gt;(int initialCapacity)</code> and <code>(int, float loadFactor)</code>: tune the table size.</li>\n<li><code>new HashMap&lt;&gt;(Map m)</code>: a copy of another map.</li>\n<li>Declare the variable as <code>Map&lt;K, V&gt;</code>, not <code>HashMap</code>.</li>\n</ul>",
